7fde 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1a8b3403/uploads/origins/a056cf93-d63f-40e2-8613-0961615a4c1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b483c766ba0de4d4a2f454562deda07 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Good evening, Dotmochi! I would like to request an illustration for my stuffed animal name tag...!\n\nCharacter materials (Dropbox link)\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/s0luvdx65qih2nd/AACD98_p8w6tqhuZ8k1zjc_ja?dl=0\n\nRequest details\nFull body illustration with collar.\n(https://x.com/water_citrus/status/1666117883834011648?s=61 I like deformed isometric cute like this illustration...!)\n\n(I like deformed body like this illustration...!) - Cute pose with paw pads visible, smiling expression.\n\n(I would like to use the name as a name tag with the illustration drawn by Dotmochi, using the name designed by someone else.)\n\nTransparent data without text\n\nIf there are any flaws, you can cancel the order...!\nThank you very much for your cooperation. 🙇‍♂️\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/s0luvdx65qih2nd/AACD98_p8w6tqhuZ8k1zjc_ja?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@walking_packs/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4fb7a057/uploads/origins/8404b01e-e3f5-4347-8adc-099894a3bd2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac7496e095db46c09100c05ae42bed11", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4fb7a057/uploads/origins/8404b01e-e3f5-4347-8adc-099894a3bd2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac7496e095db46c09100c05ae42bed11, https://si.imgix.net/4fb7a057/uploads/origins/8404b01e-e3f5-4347-8adc-099894a3bd2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05e293afe22ef28c2b1c16866a378e01 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4fb7a057/uploads/origins/8404b01e-e3f5-4347-8adc-099894a3bd2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=71433edd87bbec27052fad7dd31d33ee 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "We don't have a name for her yet, but please leave all the poses, compositions, etc. to this girl! https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xYvOT7QjE8kb8ziEtRhNL_ThwkDcTa6P/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@walking_packs/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1be4480/uploads/origins/4ba7937f-e2ea-4324-96a9-ea75af2125e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fe31b36cf8a968146afa6d97a06be00", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1be4480/uploads/origins/4ba7937f-e2ea-4324-96a9-ea75af2125e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fe31b36cf8a968146afa6d97a06be00, https://si.imgix.net/f1be4480/uploads/origins/4ba7937f-e2ea-4324-96a9-ea75af2125e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39b1006689f1f8c95244c2c2600ab616 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1be4480/uploads/origins/4ba7937f-e2ea-4324-96a9-ea75af2125e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4446048a778eb7cb84a93a66484c9129 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello teacher (▽｀)ノ, I saw your picture on Twitter and liked it very much, so I would like to make a new double-sided stand-up drawing for the child in the following tweet. A front picture and a back picture, but not completely front and back and left and right symmetrical picture, the angle of the positive and negative characters are a little to the side. The pose is random, as long as it is cute.\nLink to the tweet:\nhttps://twitter.com/LONG_001120/status/1657955258436567041?s=19\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LONG_001120/status/1651208132939620352?s=19\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LONG_001120/status/1657925530816253952?s=19\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LONG_001120/status/1657957927301574656?s=19\n(This is the original double-sided stand-up drawing, in which the burgundy part needs to be modified to bright pink)\nI really like the third picture in the following t